  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "We substitute the options in the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nOption 1) +, ×, =, −\n\n5 + __**16 × 23**__ = 70 - 33\n\n__**5 + **____368__ = 70 - 33\n\n373 = __**70 - 33**__\n\n373 ≠ 37\n\nOption 2) ×, −, =, −\n__**5 × 16**__ - 23 = 70 - 33\n\n__**80 - 23**__ = __**70 - 33**__\n\n57 ≠ 37\n\nOption 3) ×, +, =, +\n__**5 × 16**__ + 23 = 70 + 33\n\n__**80 + 23**__ = __**70 + 33**__\n\n103 = 103\n\nOption 4) −, ×, =, +\n5 - __**16 × 23**__ = 70 + 33\n\n5 - 368 = __**70 + 33**__\n\n__**5 - 368**__ = 103\n\n-363 ≠ 103\n\nHence, the correct answer is **option (3).**",
